sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer
    participant Product as Mesa Tica
    Customer->>Product: Open menu
    Product-->>Customer: Dishes, descriptions, prices and availability
    alt Restaurant open
    Product-->>Customer: Pickup ordering available
    else Restaurant closed
    Product-->>Customer: Browsing allowed, next opening shown, submission unavailable
    end
    Customer->>Product: Choose a dish
    alt Available
    Product-->>Customer: Add to cart
    else Unavailable
    Product-->>Customer: Explain unavailable, no addition
    end
